  "label": {
    "en": [
      "A vintage black-and-white postcard commemorating the Internationales Musikfest (International Music Festival) held in 1904 in Muttenz, Switzerland. The postcard features drawings of a church with a clock tower, a large building likely used for the festival, and a hilltop ruin in the background. There is handwritten script in German at the bottom and official printed labeling."
